# NOTE: PR_EXPECT for scope is now "green" (not "green|not-applicable"): scope is
# never legitimately not-applicable in a PR bundle (its precondition is
# branch-matches and a PR is always on a phase branch), so the harness REQUIRES
# scope green here. A scope not-applicable (e.g. a detached-HEAD regression) now
# FAILS the harness instead of passing vacuously.

